  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "South of 30A | Inlet Beach | Gated Community | Outdoor Pool<br><br>Escape to \"Ocean Serenade\", proudly managed by Beach Getaways. The home that is located South of 30A in Inlet Beach, next to Rosemary Beach, and will quickly become your family's favorite beach getaway. You and your family can relax on the private screened in patio or down by the luxurious community outdoor pool. Special features include; a private outdoor shower, gated community and a short walk (970' to be exact) from Rosemary Beach. With our no fuss check-in you are ready for beach fun as soon as you arrive. Your next beach getaway is just a click away.<br><br>Experience the Beach Getaways Heart of Hospitality: Providing Happy Connections and Lasting Memories!<br><br>1st Floor Entry Level <br><br>Features 3 Bedrooms & Living Space<br> • Wet Bar, Microwave & Mini-Fridge<br> • TV & Gaming<br> • Full Size Washer and Dryer<br> • Patio Seating w/Private Grill<br><br>Guest Room 1<br> • King Size Bed<br> • Full Bath Featuring Double Sink Vanity<br><br>Guest Room 2<br> • Queen Size Daybed<br> • En Suite Bath w/Walk In Shower<br><br>Guest Room 3<br> • 2 Sets of Twin Size Bunk Beds<br><br>2nd Level<br>Living, Kitchen & Dining Areas<br> • Plenty of Comfortable Seating<br> • Flat Screen Smart TV<br> • Dining Table w/Seating for 6<br> • Additional Seating at Breakfast Bars<br> • Fully Equipped Kitchen Features; Granite Countertops, Stainless Appliances and Wine Fridge<br> • Balcony Entrance with Comfortable Outdoor Seating<br> • Guest Half Bath<br><br>Primary Bedroom<br> • California King Size Bed<br> • En-Suite Bath w/Walk-In Shower & Claw Foot Tub<br> • Private Covered Balcony<br><br>En Suite Bath Features<br> • Tiled Walk-In Shower<br> • Granite Countertops & Double Sink Vanity<br><br>Additional Amenities<br> •\t4 Bikes<br> •\tCommunity Outdoor Pool<br> •\tPrivate Outdoor Shower<br> •\tGated Community<br> •\tInlet Beach Access<br><br>You're just a walk away from the shops and restaurants of the Villages of South Walton & Rosemary Beach. You can rent bikes, shop, jumpstart your morning with a coffee or relax with an evening cocktail while the kids enjoy an ice cream. During spring & summer, you'll find live outdoor entertainment.<br><br>​​​​​​​*A short drive to Destin, Seaside, Panama City Beach, Frank Brown Park, Pier Park, Gulf World and much more family fun!<br><br>*Rosemary Beach Farmers Market every Sunday featuring local artisans and incredible food!<br><br>*Snorkel Tours *Charter Fishing *Dolphin Cruises *Local Winery *Amazing Restaurants *Shopping *Kayaking *World Renowned Golf Courses *MORE!<br><br>Policies:<br> 1. Check in is 4pm | Check out is 10am.<br> 2. No Smoking in condo or on balcony.<br> 3. Pets are NOT allowed.<br> 4. Loud parties or gatherings will not be tolerated.<br> 5. Must be at least 25 years old to rent. For groups of Single Adults, all guests in the group must be at least 25 years of age and proof of age will be required before approving the reservation.<br> 6. Please Note: Exterior security cameras are present and in place at the front and back of the home for added safety monitoring. Rest assured, your privacy is paramount, and no cameras are installed inside the living areas. <br><br>Locally Managed by:<br>My Beach Getaways<br>Beaches of Alabama & Florida Gulf Coast",
